WEBVTT

00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:02.580
What do we do?

00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:03.790
What do we do?

00:00:03.790 --> 00:00:05.790
To be able to protect everyone?

00:00:05.790 --> 00:00:09.830
Wait a minute! We're gonna talk it over

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.200
Grownups are so busy

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:13.330
So busy

00:00:13.330 --> 00:00:15.330
We can't count on them

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:16.200
That's right

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.080
This town

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:21.160
We'll help it with Colors Power!

00:00:29.620 --> 00:00:34.660
Pin-pin-pinches come suddenly

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:35.290
And so!

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:35.910
And so?

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:36.500
You know!

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:37.250
Gear up?

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:39.700
We have to stay on guard every day

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:42.120
It looks like our chance

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:44.250
Which is it?

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:44.750
I'm not sure!

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:45.370
Go on, think

00:00:45.370 --> 00:00:45.950
But you know!

00:00:45.950 --> 00:00:46.790
Basically

00:00:46.790 --> 00:00:49.290
You don't know until you try

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:51.830
Peace of mind is far away

00:00:51.830 --> 00:00:53.830
Is what I hear my heart say

00:00:53.830 --> 00:00:56.330
Now be sneaky and bold

00:00:56.330 --> 00:00:58.330
And do your best!

00:00:58.910 --> 00:01:03.450
What times, what times, are the most fun?

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:07.620
We'll have to investigate more and more

00:01:07.620 --> 00:01:10.950
Do grownups have the energy? They don't have energy

00:01:10.950 --> 00:01:13.080
Kids have energy!

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:15.700
So leave it all to us!

00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:18.830
We'll do our part with Colors Power!

00:01:24.790 --> 00:01:26.450
Three-Stars Jump!

00:01:35.620 --> 00:01:37.000
Look, look!

00:01:38.410 --> 00:01:39.660
I can reach!

00:01:39.910 --> 00:01:41.410
Wow, you can!

00:01:41.410 --> 00:01:43.370
And I can do this!

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:48.410
Oh! I saw Yui's panties.

00:01:48.410 --> 00:01:49.120
What?!

00:01:49.120 --> 00:01:50.910
Just kidding. I didn't see anything.

00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:52.410
Really?

00:01:52.660 --> 00:01:54.040
Really, I did see them.

00:01:54.040 --> 00:01:55.660
Did you or didn't you?

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:00.750
I sneezed.

00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:04.200
It's hay fever. That's a pollen sneeze.

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:07.910
It is not a pollen sneeze. It's a normal sneeze.

00:02:07.910 --> 00:02:09.700
She says it's a normal sneeze.

00:02:11.450 --> 00:02:13.700
Sat-chan, do you have pollen sneezes?

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:14.750
Me?

00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:16.660
I have...

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:20.790
...cute sneezes!

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:22.000
Okay.

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:25.250
I don't get hay fever, either.

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:27.120
We're all healthy!

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:28.870
Yup! We're healthy!

00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:31.500
We all have normal sneezes!

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:33.620
I have cute sneezes!

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:36.620
Hi.

00:02:36.620 --> 00:02:37.870
Nono-chan!

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:41.950
That's a pollen sneeze.

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:44.500
Live and in person!

00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:46.870
Nono-chan has pollen allergies!

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:49.910
It's not pollen allergies. I'm very healthy.

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:52.870
You shouldn't lie.

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:57.700
Why does everyone insist that I have to have hay fever?

00:02:57.700 --> 00:02:59.830
If I ever admit to that, I've lost the war.

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:04.000
You know what they say.

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:04.000
All illness is actually psychiatry.

00:03:04.290 --> 00:03:05.950
Illness is psychia-tree?

00:03:06.700 --> 00:03:08.540
You mean like that tree?

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:10.830
So it IS pollen allergies!

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:12.790
It's not pollen allergies.

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:15.330
I know a cheat to stop sneezes.

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:16.950
What? Really?

00:03:16.950 --> 00:03:19.660
They make cheats like that? Awesome!

00:03:19.830 --> 00:03:21.290
Want to try it?

00:03:21.290 --> 00:03:24.700
I totally do! But this isn't hay fever.

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:27.160
When you feel a sneeze coming on, raise your hand.

00:03:27.450 --> 00:03:28.540
Okay, got it!

00:03:53.660 --> 00:03:54.620
Anything?

00:04:07.370 --> 00:04:08.160
Achoo!

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:13.950
It didn't work.

00:04:14.200 --> 00:04:15.330
Failed attempt.

00:04:18.160 --> 00:04:20.450
I held back for that one.

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:22.870
Next time, I'll hit you for real.

00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:24.700
And I'll help!

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:26.120
Me, too!

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:29.910
No, really... that's okay.

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:31.580
She raised her hand!

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:32.580
Take that!

00:04:36.620 --> 00:04:38.580
Did the sneezing stop, Nonoka?

00:04:39.080 --> 00:04:41.290
Don't let it beat you, Nono-chan!

00:04:41.290 --> 00:04:42.660
You can do it, Nonoka!

00:04:42.660 --> 00:04:46.500
Forgive me! I was wrong!

00:04:50.080 --> 00:04:51.700
It's hay fever.

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:55.700
I admit it. I have pollen allergies.

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:59.000
I won't rely on folk remedies anymore.

00:04:59.660 --> 00:05:01.700
I'll go right to the doctor.

00:05:01.700 --> 00:05:04.330
So please forgive me.

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:05.870
Nono-chan.

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:08.120
You did good, Nonoka!

00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:10.830
I feel so bad for you!

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:12.830
Not a bad effort, for you.

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:17.040
This doesn't make any sense.

00:05:20.870 --> 00:05:22.660
See you later, everyone.

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:30.410
Let's avenge Nono-chan!

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:31.250
Yeah.

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:33.950
We will rid this town of all the pollen!

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:37.580
We'll uproot all the trees!

00:05:37.950 --> 00:05:41.500
Let's go! We're gonna protect our town!

00:05:45.330 --> 00:05:48.290
I know we said we'd uproot all of them.

00:05:48.620 --> 00:05:51.200
But there sure are a lot of trees.

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:54.620
Let's just start by beating down the ones over there!

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:57.410
Extra...

00:05:57.410 --> 00:05:59.410
Virgin...

00:05:59.410 --> 00:06:00.450
Wait, Sat-chan!

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:02.700
Huh?

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:05.540
Look closer. This is a cherry tree.

00:06:05.540 --> 00:06:07.500
What? It is?

00:06:07.790 --> 00:06:09.330
Now that you mention it...

00:06:09.330 --> 00:06:12.580
we do see cherry blossoms around here in the spring.

00:06:12.790 --> 00:06:14.450
Cherry trees are good trees.

00:06:14.450 --> 00:06:17.620
Without them, we can't have flower viewing picnics.

00:06:17.620 --> 00:06:20.540
No flower picnics? I don't think I'd like that.

00:06:20.700 --> 00:06:24.290
But our mission is to uproot all the trees in town.

00:06:24.290 --> 00:06:25.910
What do we do, Leader?

00:06:28.830 --> 00:06:30.620
I'm changing the mission!

00:06:30.870 --> 00:06:34.370
Our mission now is to uproot all trees

00:06:30.870 --> 00:06:34.370
except the cherry trees!

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:35.910
Yeah!

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:43.200
This tree looks like a bad one.

00:06:43.200 --> 00:06:45.000
Yeah, really bad!

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:46.120
Indeed.

00:06:46.330 --> 00:06:48.330
Okay! I'm taking it down!

00:06:48.330 --> 00:06:50.330
Extra...

00:06:50.330 --> 00:06:52.290
Virgin...

00:06:52.290 --> 00:06:53.450
Wait, Sat-chan!

00:06:54.830 --> 00:06:55.830
Huh?

00:06:55.830 --> 00:06:56.950
Look!

00:06:57.290 --> 00:06:58.330
Is that...?

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:00.000
It's a bagworm.

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:03.330
Nice job spotting it, Leader!

00:07:03.450 --> 00:07:07.330
If we defeat this tree, the bagworm will fall, won't it?

00:07:07.330 --> 00:07:08.750
Of course!

00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:13.660
Nothing can get hit with my Extra Virgin Oil

00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:13.660
and remain unscathed!

00:07:13.790 --> 00:07:15.620
I feel a little bad for it.

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:20.250
They were saying on TV

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:20.250
that they're on the verge of extinction.

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:24.200
What?! I don't feel a little bad - I feel a lot bad!

00:07:24.200 --> 00:07:25.950
What do we do, Leader?

00:07:28.870 --> 00:07:34.660
Now our mission will be to uproot all trees

00:07:28.870 --> 00:07:34.660
except cherry trees and trees with bagworms!

00:07:34.830 --> 00:07:36.120
Yeah!

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:45.870
Now that I think about it,

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:45.870
starting with the weak minion trees is too much work.

00:07:45.870 --> 00:07:48.120
Let's start with a last boss tree!

00:07:48.370 --> 00:07:50.750
You're right - this does look like a last boss.

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:54.040
It's not a cherry tree, and there aren't any bagworms.

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:58.410
But isn't this the tree

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:58.410
where we almost buried our time capsule?

00:07:58.410 --> 00:07:59.450
It is.

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:01.080
Today it's our enemy!

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:02.540
I'm gonna beat it!

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:04.660
Extra...

00:08:04.660 --> 00:08:06.750
Virgin...

00:08:11.580 --> 00:08:13.540
Virgin...

00:08:13.660 --> 00:08:14.790
Oil!

00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:23.660
Is it bleeding?

00:08:25.080 --> 00:08:28.540
Sat-chan is out of commission!

00:08:29.290 --> 00:08:30.790
Then we have no choice.

00:08:31.200 --> 00:08:34.660
I, Colors Blue, will have to accomplish this task.

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:45.330
Not even Colors Blue can get it to budge!

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:48.540
Sat-chan, back in action!

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:51.580
We'll just have to all take it on together!

00:08:51.950 --> 00:08:53.450
Formation...

00:08:53.450 --> 00:08:54.540
...B!

00:08:56.410 --> 00:08:57.160
I... don't...

00:08:57.160 --> 00:08:58.160
Take that!

00:08:57.160 --> 00:08:58.160
I... don't...

00:08:58.160 --> 00:08:59.500
Yui Power!

00:08:58.160 --> 00:08:59.500
want... to...

00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:00.040
want... to...

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:00.410
You think you're so powerful!

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:00.410
want... to...

00:09:00.410 --> 00:09:01.580
You think you're so powerful!

00:09:00.410 --> 00:09:01.580
see... you...

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:02.450
This'll show you!

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:02.450
see... you...

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:03.040
This'll show you!

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:03.040
...again?

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:03.580
...again?

00:09:04.200 --> 00:09:05.450
It's over!

00:09:05.910 --> 00:09:07.040
Hiya!

00:09:07.040 --> 00:09:08.790
Yui Attack!

00:09:08.790 --> 00:09:10.040
Take this!

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:11.500
Poop!

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:11.500
What are they doing?

00:09:11.790 --> 00:09:13.330
Excuse me, girls?

00:09:14.870 --> 00:09:16.290
It's Moka!

00:09:16.290 --> 00:09:18.620
Hi! What are you three doing?

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:20.500
We're defeating this tree.

00:09:20.500 --> 00:09:23.040
Oh. For training?

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:26.160
No, not training. We're taking revenge.

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:27.330
Revenge?

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:30.120
We're avenging Nonoka's hay fever.

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:33.450
What? Nono actually admitted she has hay fever?

00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:35.500
I never got her to admit it.

00:09:35.660 --> 00:09:37.870
She said illnesses are about psychiatry.

00:09:38.830 --> 00:09:41.660
Yup, yup. That's what she always says.

00:09:42.540 --> 00:09:44.620
But how did you get her to admit it?

00:09:44.830 --> 00:09:46.200
We hit her.

00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:47.330
You hit her?!

00:09:47.330 --> 00:09:49.660
Yeah, we were using a cheat!

00:09:49.950 --> 00:09:51.370
Sure you don't mean "beat"?

00:09:51.830 --> 00:09:54.910
It's a cheat to distract the patient

00:09:51.830 --> 00:09:54.910
by applying pain in a different area.

00:09:54.910 --> 00:09:59.750
Oh... I thought that was for things like, say, itching.

00:09:59.750 --> 00:10:01.790
Oh. Is that it?

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:03.700
There's a hole here!

00:10:04.410 --> 00:10:06.120
Let's try pushing it from this hole.

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:07.000
Okay!

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:17.000
Hey, that reminds me, did you hear

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:17.000
a lot of "wee-oo wee-oo" last night?

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:18.410
I did! 

00:10:18.410 --> 00:10:20.370
I wonder what it was about.

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:22.910
I kind of think this might work!

00:10:22.910 --> 00:10:24.160
Really?

00:10:24.160 --> 00:10:26.040
Kotoha, come help!

00:10:26.250 --> 00:10:27.330
Coming.

00:10:30.910 --> 00:10:33.620
Avenging Nono's hay fever. Wow.

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:37.200
So you're defeating the trees to get rid of all the pollen?

00:10:37.200 --> 00:10:38.500
Yup!

00:10:40.040 --> 00:10:43.250
Alright! We'll all knock it down in one strong push!

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:45.160
Ready, go!

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:49.700
You know that tree isn't a cryptomeria.

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:53.750
I said it's not a cryptomeria.

00:10:56.120 --> 00:10:58.000
What's a cryptomeria?

00:10:58.200 --> 00:11:01.330
The pollen Nonoka is allergic to is cryptomeria pollen.

00:11:01.700 --> 00:11:03.750
It comes from cryptomeria trees.

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:04.950
Cryp...

00:11:04.950 --> 00:11:06.000
...to...

00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:06.870
meria?

00:11:08.410 --> 00:11:10.660
You mean this isn't a bad tree?

00:11:10.660 --> 00:11:11.410
That's right.

00:11:11.540 --> 00:11:13.580
If it's a good tree, we have to leave it!

00:11:13.580 --> 00:11:14.910
That's right.

00:11:14.910 --> 00:11:16.790
So where are the cryptomerias?

00:11:17.750 --> 00:11:21.790
We're going to beat up all the pollen trees

00:11:17.750 --> 00:11:21.790
and save the town!

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:27.080
And you have to defeat all the cryptomeria trees?

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:28.080
Yes!

00:11:28.410 --> 00:11:32.040
Moka! Tell us where to find cryptomerias!

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:33.580
But you know...

00:11:33.910 --> 00:11:36.830
Nothing good will come of trying to hide them from us.

00:11:36.830 --> 00:11:42.200
We'll say we like Nonoka's weird bread and make it

00:11:36.830 --> 00:11:42.200
so you can't have your onigiri shop!

00:11:46.450 --> 00:11:48.160
Alright, I'll tell you.

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:56.040
There are no cryptomerias in this park.

00:11:56.040 --> 00:11:57.500
What? There aren't any?

00:11:57.500 --> 00:12:00.790
Does that mean Nonoka's allergies are all in her head?

00:12:00.790 --> 00:12:03.250
Yes. It does mean that.

00:12:03.540 --> 00:12:05.330
So remember this:

00:12:05.750 --> 00:12:08.410
Nono is a liar.

00:12:21.450 --> 00:12:23.500
Just you wait, stupid Nonoka!

00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:25.000
How dare you trick us!

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:26.830
I hate you, Nono-chan!

00:12:26.830 --> 00:12:28.700
You're gonna get a taste of my cheat move!

00:12:39.370 --> 00:12:40.660
All done!

00:12:42.870 --> 00:12:44.120
Yay!

00:12:44.500 --> 00:12:46.000
Thank you, Sat-chan!

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:49.200
So what are we changing my hairstyle for?

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:51.410
I'm so glad you asked!

00:12:51.700 --> 00:12:53.330
Today is a training day!

00:12:53.580 --> 00:12:56.540
A training day? We haven't had one of those in ages!

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:00.290
And for this training...

00:13:00.580 --> 00:13:01.500
Tada!

00:13:01.910 --> 00:13:03.790
We shalt useth these!

00:13:03.790 --> 00:13:05.830
Walkie-talkies-eth?

00:13:06.330 --> 00:13:10.200
We'll keepeth these on while we playeth

00:13:06.330 --> 00:13:10.200
ye olde hide-and-go-seek.

00:13:10.660 --> 00:13:12.080
Hide-and-seek?

00:13:12.370 --> 00:13:14.660
Why keep the walkie-talkies on?

00:13:15.250 --> 00:13:19.040
"It" shalt searcheth for places wherefore

00:13:15.250 --> 00:13:19.040
cometh ye olde signal.

00:13:19.040 --> 00:13:23.040
If you get a signal,

00:13:19.040 --> 00:13:23.040
you know someone is hiding nearby!

00:13:23.330 --> 00:13:25.250
Oh, I see-eth!

00:13:25.580 --> 00:13:29.830
And this is Colors Hide-and-Seek Training Part Two!

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:31.750
Hyper Hide-and-Seek!

00:13:31.750 --> 00:13:33.790
Oh, it's hyper now!

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:35.080
And there's an ogre!

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:36.910
That means Yui is It!

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:38.660
Oh, so that's why!

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:42.330
Come on, Koto-chan! Let's hide!

00:13:42.330 --> 00:13:43.330
'Kay.

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:47.450
I'll be It, but don't go far away like you did last time.

00:13:48.950 --> 00:13:50.830
Don't worry, we won't!

00:13:50.830 --> 00:13:52.700
You promise?

00:13:52.700 --> 00:13:54.580
Yup, promise!

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:56.830
I'll stay within five minutes of the station.

00:13:56.830 --> 00:13:58.040
Good idea.

00:13:58.200 --> 00:14:00.580
Okay, I'm hitting the switch!

00:14:04.330 --> 00:14:08.290
My hiding style has two stages. It'll be hard!

00:14:08.500 --> 00:14:09.950
Two stages?

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:11.540
What does that mean?

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:14.660
Then I'll hide somewhere easy.

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:15.950
Okay!

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:18.910
Hyper Hide-and-Seek, activate!

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:20.200
Yeah!

00:14:21.080 --> 00:14:23.290
You wait a little bit and start searching, Yui!

00:14:23.290 --> 00:14:24.580
Okay!

00:14:28.580 --> 00:14:29.120
Yay!

00:14:29.120 --> 00:14:30.120
I can still hear you.

00:14:29.120 --> 00:14:30.120
Yay!

