00:17:18.790 --> 00:17:19.620
Over there.

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:21.410
No, no, no!

00:17:21.410 --> 00:17:25.000
We're playing hide-and-seek!

00:17:21.410 --> 00:17:25.000
You can't tell me, you just can't!

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:26.250
