00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:40.370
You are so...

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:47.040
Well, I have something to do, so I'll be leaving now.

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:51.500
I was already planning to go that way, okay?

00:17:51.950 --> 00:17:53.910
Okay, see you later!

00:17:56.500 --> 00:17:58.580
That's right. I just thought of it.

00:17:58.870 --> 00:18:00.410
