00:18:34.830 --> 00:18:36.250
Found me, huh?

00:18:37.330 --> 00:18:39.870
I guess the station was too easy, after all.

00:18:39.870 --> 00:18:42.330
Easy-peasy! I totally got this.

00:18:42.620 --> 00:18:43.910
Find Sat-chan?

00:18:44.160 --> 00:18:45.040
Not yet.

00:18:45.290 --> 00:18:47.120
Then I'll help you look.

00:18:47.120 --> 00:18:48.040
Okay!

00:18:49.750 --> 00:18:51.080
Oh, hold on.

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:53.450
I got something from Sat-chan.

00:18:53.870 --> 00:18:57.450
It says, "I can't breathe. Find me, quick."

00:18:57.450 --> 00:18:58.870
Where would she be?

00:18:59.290 --> 00:19:00.120
I don't know.

00:19:00.580 --> 00:19:03.540
She said she'd be hiding in two stages.

00:19:06.870 --> 00:19:07.830
Of course!

00:19:16.580 --> 00:19:18.660
Looks like she's not here.

00:19:18.660 --> 00:19:19.950
Let's check the next one.

00:19:20.910 --> 00:19:22.450
Not here, either.

00:19:22.950 --> 00:19:23.870
Next!

00:19:26.290 --> 00:19:28.000
She's not here, either.

00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:29.080
Next!

00:19:29.250 --> 00:19:30.540
We can't find her.

00:19:31.040 --> 00:19:34.660
I thought she'd be in a restroom stall,

00:19:31.040 --> 00:19:34.660
