00:19:37.330 --> 00:19:40.080
Well, Sat-chan did say it was going to be hard.

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:43.160
A signal!

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:45.580
That sound...

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:47.620
It's the sound of a crosswalk!

00:19:48.000 --> 00:19:48.700
Yeah!

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:51.500
A crosswalk with a green light.

00:19:51.910 --> 00:19:52.870
That way!

00:19:53.620 --> 00:19:55.120
Wait for me, Kotoha!

00:19:57.700 --> 00:19:58.870
