00:20:11.870 --> 00:20:14.830
You... you finally came...

00:20:14.830 --> 00:20:15.950
It's alive!

00:20:18.290 --> 00:20:20.830
You're mine, chu-chu-cabrilla!

00:20:23.580 --> 00:20:27.000
You'll never get away from me,

00:20:23.580 --> 00:20:27.000
