00:20:31.910 --> 00:20:33.450
I-I'm dying...

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:36.620
Wait, Kotoha!

00:20:37.790 --> 00:20:40.250
Look closely at that chu-chu-cabrilla!

00:20:43.040 --> 00:20:45.830
It looks like it's being sacrificed to the pandas.

00:20:45.830 --> 00:20:47.410
It really does.

00:20:57.040 --> 00:20:58.370
I knew it.

00:20:58.370 --> 00:21:01.200
This town is being taken over by pandas!

00:21:01.500 --> 00:21:03.580
We need to meet up with Sat-chan, fast!

00:21:03.830 --> 00:21:05.750
This is no time for training!

00:21:05.750 --> 00:21:06.750
Right!

00:21:07.950 --> 00:21:11.120
Sat-chan! Where are you?

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:13.000
Come out of hiding!

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:15.950
It's a Level 4 case!

00:21:16.410 --> 00:21:17.700
Sat-chan!

00:21:18.160 --> 00:21:19.500
Come out!

00:21:22.620 --> 00:21:25.410
Um... Guys...

00:21:35.750 --> 00:21:39.540
Our sparkling signal is the first star

00:21:39.540 --> 00:21:41.580
Oops, time to go home

00:21:41.580 --> 00:21:42.620
Later, Colors!

00:21:42.620 --> 00:21:43.700
Later, Colors!

00:21:43.700 --> 00:21:46.790
The peace is kept another day

00:21:46.790 --> 00:21:47.540
We did it!

00:21:47.540 --> 00:21:50.790
Total victory for us!

00:21:51.910 --> 00:21:54.000
A chu-chu-cabrilla out on a walk

00:21:54.000 --> 00:21:55.950
Take that! Extra virgin oil!

00:21:55.950 --> 00:21:59.790
We're really busy every day

00:22:00.160 --> 00:22:02.120
Cases from level one to how high?

00:22:02.120 --> 00:22:04.120
We'll solve any mystery!

00:22:04.120 --> 00:22:05.250
