00:22:06.160 --> 00:22:08.080
Call us again when you're in a pinch!

00:22:08.080 --> 00:22:11.290
For the peace of this town!

00:22:11.450 --> 00:22:15.950
Saying, "Ready, go!" with the orange sky

00:22:15.950 --> 00:22:19.870
Let's go home together

00:22:19.870 --> 00:22:24.080
Tomorrow we can probably have even more excitement

00:22:24.250 --> 00:22:26.910
We all dash to meet at the hideout

00:22:27.540 --> 00:22:32.160
Goodbye, sun. Goodnight, town

00:22:32.160 --> 00:22:36.290
I can't wait for tomorrow

00:22:36.540 --> 00:22:40.330
My heart won't stop skipping in excitement

00:22:40.330 --> 00:22:44.660
Another day and all's well!

00:22:44.660 --> 00:22:47.250
See you tomorrow!

00:22:47.620 --> 00:22:48.790
One more time!

00:22:48.790 --> 00:22:53.120
See you tomorrow!

00:22:56.200 --> 00:22:57.330
So, um.

00:22:57.330 --> 00:23:00.450
There's something I have to say to everyone.

00:23:00.450 --> 00:23:01.910
What is it, Leader?

00:23:01.910 --> 00:23:02.870
What's wrong?

00:23:02.870 --> 00:23:05.160
It's really, really sad.

00:23:05.160 --> 00:23:07.870
But as of today... I...

00:23:07.870 --> 00:23:10.080
Is it poop? Are you gonna turn into poop?

00:23:10.080 --> 00:23:14.200
What? No! Ugh! Nobody's going to turn into poo!

00:23:14.200 --> 00:23:15.450
I know.

00:23:15.450 --> 00:23:20.080
You're going to tell us that today is going to be

00:23:15.450 --> 00:23:20.080
our last Colors Evaluation Meeting, right?

00:23:20.080 --> 00:23:22.660
Wow, Kotoha! How did you know?

00:23:22.660 --> 00:23:23.750
Elementary.

00:23:23.750 --> 00:23:27.200
Next week is the last episode,

00:23:23.750 --> 00:23:27.200
so we won't need any more previews.

00:23:27.200 --> 00:23:28.540
Last episode?

00:23:29.000 --> 00:23:30.200
I see...

00:23:30.500 --> 00:23:33.080
It's finally happening. The town is turning into poop.

00:23:33.080 --> 00:23:34.250
No, it's not!

00:23:34.250 --> 00:23:37.750
And they're not previews!

00:23:34.250 --> 00:23:37.750
They're Colors Evaluation Meetings!

00:23:37.750 --> 00:23:39.290
You're still saying that?
